SourceMods shared by the FV configs: cam_aqua_fv, cam_land_fv, cam_mixed_fv.

A file lives here when it is identical in every FV config that uses its
component. A file that differs between configs lives in
configs/<config>/SourceMods/ instead, never in both places.

Do not copy this directory into a case by hand. Use

    ../install_sourcemods.sh <config> $CASEROOT/SourceMods

which copies only the components in configs/<config>/COMPONENTS, then the
config's own files. (src.clm is for land/mixed only; src.cice and src.docn
are for aqua/mixed only.)

Not used by cam_aqua_se or circumbinary, which keep their full SourceMods
under configs/ (both are outside ExoCAM 2.0).
